This lets you map positions to any labels you want, including strings like `"Alice"` or `"Bob"`.

If you want, I can also show the more general `FrameTicks` form for labeling all four sides of the frame.

You can do it by overlaying text labels with `Epilog` and `Text`, for example:

```wl
SeedRandom[42, Method -> "Legacy"]; (* for reproducibility *)

mat = RandomReal[1, {3, 5}];
ArrayPlot[mat,
  Epilog -> {
    Red,
    MapIndexed[Text[#1, Reverse[#2 - 1/2]] &, Reverse[mat], {2}]
  },
