Then compute a shared range:

```mathematica
pltR = Flatten[Options[plt[#], PlotRange] & /@ Range[3] /. 
    HoldPattern[PlotRange -> x_] -> x, 1];

pltRR = {{
   Min@pltR[[All, 1, 1]], Max@pltR[[All, 1, 2]]},
   {Min@pltR[[All, 2, 1]], Max@pltR[[All, 2, 2]]}
};
```

And finally show them in a grid:

