For 2D data, give `Interpolation` the coordinates with each value, like this:

```wl
n = 30;
dat = Array[(#1 - n/2)^2 + (#2 - n/2)^2 &, {n, n}];

f = Interpolation[
  Flatten[Array[{{#1, #2}, dat[[#1, #2]]} &, {n, n}], 1]
];

