```wl
ipdat = DeleteCases[
  Flatten[Array[{{#1, #2}, dat[[#1, #2]]} &, {n, n}], 1],
  _?(PossibleZeroQ[Last@#] &)
];

g = Interpolation[ipdat];
```

Then `g[x, y]` gives a 2D interpolated value at the coordinate `{x, y}`.

So the key fix is: interpolate using `{x, y}` coordinates, not a flattened 1D list.

