dt = Table[{Sin[3 t] Cos[t], Sin[t] Sin[5 t], Sin[2 t]}, {t, -10, 10, 0.005}];

zc = zeroCrossings[Last /@ dt - 0.5];

From there, you can interpolate each crossing point between the two neighboring samples.

