A stable alternative is to place the labels manually with `Text` in `Graphics3D`, using scaled coordinates so they stay in fixed positions:

```mathematica
Graphics3D[{
  Text[Style[#1, 25, Bold, Black], Scaled@#2] & @@@ 
    {{"x", {.9, .5, .55}}, {"y", {.5, .9, .55}}, {"z", {.5, .55, .9}}}
}]
```

This gives you fixed label placement instead of automatically attached axis labels.

