If you want to remove all occurrences of numbers from the first list that appear in the second list, one direct approach is to use the provided function:

fastRF[a_List, b_List] :=
  Module[{c, o, x},
    c = Join[b, a];
    o = Ordering[c];
    x = 1 - 2 UnitStep[-1 - Length[b] + o];
    x = FoldList[Max[#, 0] + #2 &, x];
